From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 23:46:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] deploy: support forced local Node cutover

Add --force-node-cutover to deploy and preview flows, negotiate cutover protocol version 1 before sending it, and warn that interrupted actions may have completed external effects. Keep dry runs and internal development pushes non-forced.

Send the optional force request through deploy2, surface a committed cutover failure as an explicit fatal result, and include application-declared Node pool modules in Node bundle size telemetry.
